/T (TD learning is a unique approach that utilizes both DP and the MC method, as we learned in the first section of this chapter. While TD learning is a model-free method, it also bootstraps like DP. Later on, we delved into how to perform prediction tasks with TD learning, and we explored the algorithm of the TD prediction method.)
