/T (Moving forward, we examined how TD learning can be used for control tasks. Initially, we learned about the on-policy TD control method known as SARSA. Subsequently, we explored the off-policy TD control method called Q learning. We also learned how to apply these methods in the Frozen Lake environment to discover the optimal policy.)
/E (Moving forward, we examined how TD learning can be used for control tasks. Initially, we learned about the on-policy TD control method known as SARSA. Subsequently, we explored the off-policy TD control method called Q learning. We also learned how to apply these methods in the Frozen Lake environment to discover the optimal policy.)
